WEBVTT

NOTE
Estimated timing, not word-aligned. Spoken chapter cues are authoritative.

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.359
Beneath the same dawn, two beginnings take shape.

2
00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:08.032
One mystery waits beneath northern ice.

3
00:00:08.032 --> 00:00:14.201
Another grows inside an ordinary family, protected by a name the
world is allowed to know.

4
00:00:14.201 --> 00:00:14.818
Yan Shuo.

5
00:00:14.818 --> 00:00:22.220
Behind that public identity is Yan Shuo'er, a girl whose beauty and
unusual gifts make protection necessary.

6
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:26.196
The disguise must never become a cage around her strength.

7
00:00:26.196 --> 00:00:29.554
A flawed first soul spirit becomes a living bond.

8
00:00:29.554 --> 00:00:36.340
Friendship becomes trust, rivalry becomes training, and no earned
gain arrives without consequence.

9
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:46.210
Beside Lan Xuanyu's unfolding story, Dorm Three Three Six must keep
its own place: Yan, Song Yichen, and Luo Haoran, learning to move as
a team.

10
00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:51.694
Through a protected cocoon and an earned awakening, red-gold wings
finally open.

11
00:00:51.694 --> 00:00:54.573
But strength does not solve every problem.

12
00:00:54.573 --> 00:01:04.649
At the edge of the published story, two wounded beasts guard an
immortal herb, and the children still have to decide what they can
honestly afford.

13
00:01:04.649 --> 00:01:05.540
Fire Phoenix.

14
00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:07.048
Strength has a memory.

15
00:01:07.048 --> 00:01:08.281
So does the world.

